(7143261, 1095099, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pov! And the concentric waves are like a target, zeroing in on the sweet spot. Love it, even if the yellows are a bit extreme</td>', 'Very interesting pov! And the concentric waves are like a target, zeroing in on the sweet spot. Love it, even if the yellows are a bit extreme', '2013-12-16 02:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
