(7143289, 1095195, 124190, '<td valign="top">I have reoccurring dreams about interesting swimming pools in places I see in my mind''s eye....in places where I think there should be one.....this is from one of my dreams....almost deja vu....</td>', 'I have reoccurring dreams about interesting swimming pools in places I see in my mind''s eye....in places where I think there should be one.....this is from one of my dreams....almost deja vu....', '2013-12-16 02:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
