(7143361, 1095341, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is gorgeous.  I really like the simplicity and stop action.  That pop of magenta really is eye catching. :)</td>', 'Oh this is gorgeous.  I really like the simplicity and stop action.  That pop of magenta really is eye catching. :)', '2013-12-16 08:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
