(7143364, 1095346, 15711, '<td valign="top">OMG  That is just perfect.  He is like a beacon amidst the grays and browns of winter.  Truly glorious.</td>', 'OMG  That is just perfect.  He is like a beacon amidst the grays and browns of winter.  Truly glorious.', '2013-12-16 08:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
