(7143404, 1095312, 144365, '<td valign="top">Taking a guess, Minso? <br/>Doesn''t matter, it''s my top vote in the challenge. It attempts to follow some inane rule, but more importantly, it''s just a good image. <br/> <br/>Critiques: <br/>- I would have either put a little more catch light on her left eye or burned it right out. It gets caught on her cheek, but it''s in that 50/50 range on her eye. <br/>- I might have let the background travel further to the left. Not much, just enough so you know it there and not an hair more.</td>', 'Taking a guess, Minso? Doesn''t matter, it''s my top vote in the challenge. It attempts to follow some inane rule, but more importantly, it''s just a good image.  Critiques: - I would have either put a little more catch light on her left eye or burned it right out. It gets caught on her cheek, but it''s in that 50/50 range on her eye. - I might have let the background travel further to the left. Not much, just enough so you know it there and not an hair more.', '2013-12-16 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7143409, 1095338, 144365, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t tell you what it is, but I enjoy this photo. It''s a cacophony of everything, but somehow it works. <br/> <br/>Here''s one instance where I wish it was a little sharper; not through editing, but simply better focus. <br/> <br/>Giving this a nine.</td>', 'Couldn''t tell you what it is, but I enjoy this photo. It''s a cacophony of everything, but somehow it works.  Here''s one instance where I wish it was a little sharper; not through editing, but simply better focus.  Giving this a nine.', '2013-12-16 11:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7143412, 1095345, 144365, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the dinosaur and the chicken, I would''ve given this the much lower vote. It''s not anywhere near the technical chops of some of the other entries, but that''s irrelevant. Cleaning up some exposure/lighting issues, I''d hang this on my wall. People would look at it. People would talk about it.<br/> <br/>Also, is that a mermaid? Why doesn''t the skier have skis?<br/> <br/>Gave this an eight.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the dinosaur and the chicken, I would''ve given this the much lower vote. It''s not anywhere near the technical chops of some of the other entries, but that''s irrelevant. Cleaning up some exposure/lighting issues, I''d hang this on my wall. People would look at it. People would talk about it. Also, is that a mermaid? Why doesn''t the skier have skis? Gave this an eight.', '2013-12-16 11:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
